fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmessage.html#gst_message_new_device_monitor_started","fragment":"\n\tgst_message_new_device_monitor_started\n\n\n\tGst.Message.prototype.new_device_monitor_started\n\n\n\tGst.Message.new_device_monitor_started\n\nCreates a new device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started\nmessage is produced by a GstDeviceMonitor once it has started probing\ndevices. It does not indicate whether any GstDeviceProvider instances\nsupport monitoring at all, only whether at least one was able to start\nprobing.\nParameters:\nThe GstObject that created the message\nWhether the monitor was started successfully\na newly allocated GstMessage\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCreates a new device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started\nmessage is produced by a Gst.DeviceMonitor once it has started probing\ndevices. It does not indicate whether any Gst.DeviceProvider instances\nsupport monitoring at all, only whether at least one was able to start\nprobing.\nParameters:\nThe Gst.Object that created the message\nWhether the monitor was started successfully\na newly allocated Gst.Message\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCreates a new device-monitor-started message. The device-monitor-started\nmessage is produced by a Gst.DeviceMonitor once it has started probing\ndevices. It does not indicate whether any Gst.DeviceProvider instances\nsupport monitoring at all, only whether at least one was able to start\nprobing.\nParameters:\nThe Gst.Object that created the message\nWhether the monitor was started successfully\na newly allocated Gst.Message\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});